{start_of_verse: Verse 1}
[Eb/Bb]Twelve [Bb]governors ruled [Eb/Bb]over all Is[Bb]rael
[F/A]Sup[Gm7]plying provi[Eb]sions for the king and [Bb]house [F/A]
[Gm7]Each one held a month [Eb]of the whole [Bb]year
Ben-[Eb]Hur in the hills of Ephraim
[Bb/D]Ben-[Cm7]Dek-er in Makaz and Shaalbim [F]
Ben-[Cm7]H-esed in Arubboth and [F]Hepher
{end_of_verse}

{start_of_verse: Pre-Chorus}
[Eb]In all the region [F]of Naphath [Bb]Dor [F/A]
[Eb]Ben-A-bi-na-dab [F]held his [Gm7]place
[Gm7/F]A [Eb]governor among the twelve [Bb/D]names
[Eb]Keeping the house[F]hold in good or[Bb]der
{end_of_verse}

{start_of_chorus: Chorus}
[F/A]He had [Bb]Solomon's daughter Tap[Eb]hath as his [Bb]wife
[F/A]A [Gm]bond of loyalty [Eb]and royal [Bb]grace
[F/A]In [Gm]the district of [Eb]Naphath Dor
[Bb]Her [F/A]name is [Gm]remem[Gm7/F]bered [F]in that [Bb]line [Eb/Bb][Bb][Eb/Bb]
{end_of_chorus}

{start_of_verse: Verse 2}
[Bb]Baana son of A[F/A]hilud in Taanach [Bb]
[F/A]Me[Gm]giddo and Beth [Eb]Shan by Za[Bb]rethan [F/A]
[Gm]From Beth Shan [Eb]to Abel Me[Bb]holah [F/A]
[Eb]Stretching out as far as Jokmeam [Bb/D]
[Cm7]Solomon had many wives of royal birth [F]
And three [Cm7]hundred con[F]cubines by his [Bb]side
{end_of_verse}

